Z||000001||Tigger||10-14-2000||01:30 PM||||Have you heard of Burnout Drag Racing (PCE) or the soon to be released IHRA drag racing version?  It's a great game if your a fan of the 1/4 mile.  You can drag race online for free at Mplayer.com<P>I like Nascar3 and Sports Car GT for the realistic bumper to bumper racing.  To let off some road rage I like to play "Driver" and Midtown madness.<P>I don't play many shoot-em up games online, Nerf Arena Blast is cool (no blood, just foam projectiles), but I find it easier to shoot the stupid computer opponents I guess.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  I don't have a lot of time to sit down and learn where all the hidden power ups and hiding places are, but I do ok.<P>------------------<BR>T-T-F-N, Tah Tah For Now!<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/tigger.gif">            <BR>   <A HREF="mailto:RacingStripes@hotmail.com">RacingStripes@hotmail.com</A>  <p>[This message has been edited by Tigger (edited 10-14-2000).]||||reg||1
